5/05/19/3348029/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はちゃんと隠してますっ|´-`)ﾁﾗｯ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは乃木ビンゴの収録の時の写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだった？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は～い   のぎ天見た⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木團かっこ良かったー‼︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、台湾に行ったメンバーから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お土産もらったの ❤️（≧∇≦）\n台湾歩いてたら まあやに似合う服があったみたいで、皆が「まあやっぽい～！」って買ってきてくれたの～\nありがとう～使ってるよ～❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、まだ言ってなかったね\nかずみんから何もらったの？って質問があったからね\n誕生日プレゼントにね\nかずみんは野菜の栽培セットで可愛いの～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今育ててるの～またモバメとかで写真送るね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁちゃんからも、まあやに渡したい物がある～って言って、ロクシタンの凄く香の良いお風呂で使う物だったから、使うのもったいな～大事に使うよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にもいろいろ入ってて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもお菓子ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ƭʜᵃℕҡ ყօϋ୨୧ᐝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は夏の全国ツアーで、初めて全員で広島でコンサートが出来る～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいようなドキドキとワクワクしてる\n2日間あるから皆広島にも来てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮島の厳島神社もあるし、、\nあっ！鹿さんには気をつけてね\n鹿煎餅を買ったらすぐに沢山の鹿さんが近づいてくるよ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ね～もみじ饅頭は、揚げもみじを食べてみて～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがすっごく美味しいから～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆は お好み焼きには マヨネーズ付ける？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0022.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/05/19/3348029/0023.gif","alt":""},{"ty